Package: TraplineTools
Type: Package
Title: Tools for reporting on Maruia trapline data
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Peter", "Alspach", email = "paalspach@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A series of functions to facilitate analysing and reporting on the Trap.NZ data.  It has been built for data from Maruia (Te Maruia Waka Huia), but may also be useful for other sites (e.g. Nina-Doubtful).
